        "label": "Guidance Profile",
        "config": {
          "question": "How should the guidance be tailored to the user's profile?",
          "instructions": "Use the user's role, jurisdiction, and language preference to adapt the tone, scope, and framing of any guidance. The profile should influence all downstream recommendations, including how issues are explained, what next steps are suggested, and which resources may be relevant. Where the jurisdiction matters, keep recommendations aligned to the governing local law or process. If the profile is incomplete, provide the best available guidance while noting the missing context.",
